SCOPE

This license covers the software in this repository: the `pipeline/`,
`evaluation/` and `report/` packages and the documentation accompanying them.

It does NOT cover the neuron reconstructions under `data/`. Most of those were
produced by third parties and are redistributed here under their originating
archives' terms, which are not ours to relicense. See `data/LICENSE.md`.

The trained model files under `pipeline/models/` are released under this
license, but they are derived from the `data/` corpus; anyone redistributing
them should read `data/LICENSE.md` as well.
